     Not ph-house: the Phosphor subset in assets/icons/ is generated from the
     glyphs NS-Design-System actually uses, and it has no house. A glyph that
     is not in the subset renders as EMPTY SPACE — no error, no fallback box,
     nothing in the console — so this is a real substitution rather than a
     preference. Compass reads as "start here", which is what a home link is
